        <activityName xml:lang="en">Furnace, wood chips, softwood, 5000kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Furnace, wood chips, softwood, 5000kW
Inventory refers to the production of a wood chips furnace 5MW. Composition of the previous inventory was used and updated with the average weight of current wood chips furnaces available in Switzerland.\nTechnology: average technology\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Holzenergie\nLocal subcategory: Heizungssysteme\nUVEK 2022 source file:EcoSpold_furnace_wood chips_5000kW_v0.3_gr_lwa.xml\n\n
UUID: 416cc44a-050c-3654-a5ee-506e61d3bb0b
Includes materials, transports and energy used for the fabrication of the furnace, the chimney, the storage silo, the automatic fuel supply and the automatic control technique.
Location: undefined
Technology: average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_416cc44a-050c-3654-a5ee-506e61d3bb0b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
